@title Cross references fade or hide with Shift+X; the selected coil stays clear (1920x1080)
@area Schematic
@sizes 1920x1080
# Shift+X steps the cross references on screen: full, faded, hidden, full. Faded keeps the layout and lowers the opacity so they stay out of the way of lines, parts and text; selecting a coil brings its table back. A status bar chip says what is on and clicks back. The PDF always prints them in full.
open qa/fixtures/contact-mirror.kopercad
wait 30
key PageDown
wait 10
shot full
key shift+x
wait 20
shot faded
click 690 293
wait 30
shot faded-coil-selected-is-clear
key escape
wait 10
key shift+x
wait 20
shot hidden
key shift+x
wait 20
shot full-again
check_layout
